71dbc15e311d550fe271151a830e9a8be546e2a8e3305005f24d618db80e","saves":{"1":["","","","                                                                                                                [Press SPACE to begin.]","","Do you want to RESTORE a saved game?","Adventure in Humongous Cave","David Malmberg's AGT version of \"Adventure\"","with some \"extra added\" features","Ported to Inform By Al Golden","Last Compiled On: 12/02/05","Type \"HELP\" for HelpMenu \"CAVEHELP\" when underground","","Release 1 / Serial number 000001 / Inform v6.30 Library 6/11","","Somewhere nearby is Humongous Cave, where others have found fortunes in treasure and gold, though it is rumored that some who enter are never seen again. The object of the game is for you to explore the cave and return (safely) with as much treasure as possible. The cave is a mysterious and magical place. You will face many puzzling and perilous challenges as you explore.","","End of Road","You are standing at the end of a road before a small brick building.","Around you is a forest. A small stream flows out of the building through a pair of one-foot pipes and down a gully to the south. Next to the door of the building, there is a faded sign.","","There is an order form here.","","","Objects Carried:","nothing","","Objects in Sack:","The knapsack is closed.","examine knapsack","The knapsack is about a foot square and is brown. It has a flap which can be opened and closed.","",">examine sign","The sign is about two-feet square. The letters are quite faded and difficult to read.","","Open knapsack","You open the Knapsack revealing:","  a bunch of wooden matches","",">close knapsack","You close the Knapsack.","",">open knapsack","You open the Knapsack revealing:","  a bunch of wooden matches","",">take matches","You take the wooden matches from the sack.","",">examine matches","The matches are just that. Wooden matches. Not long ones or fancy matches, just plain old regular matches. Each match will last exactly 10 turns before self-extinguishing.","","","examine knapsack","The knapsack is about a foot square and is brown. It has a flap which can be opened and closed.","",">close knapsack","You close the Knapsack.","","save"]}}}